	(text "MAX2871 NOTES (DS Rev 4)\n- One 1u 10V X5R 0402 on every supply pin (C607-C609, C611-C613), branch caps C602/C603 and NOISE_FILT/BIAS_FILT/REG (C614-C616).\n  Place each 1u directly at its pin, own GND via at or in the pad. Check the part's DC-bias curve at 3.3V; no Y5V.\n- C610: C0G 0402 on VCC_RF, series-resonant at 5.8 GHz when mounted (~1-3 pF, from vendor S-params), closest to pin 16.\n- C618-C621 DC blocks: 0402 C0G near series resonance at 5.8 GHz. R605-R607 47R series: place at the ESP32 end.\n- R608/R609 100k hold CE/RFOUT_EN low at boot. Loop filter C622/R616/C623/R617/C624 = DS 6 GHz values; re-sim with Kvco @ 5.8 GHz. PDP=1.\n- R612 (50R term) or J602 (U.FL monitor): populate one. J601 TX connector type TBD.\n- Bead-free star: R601-R603 0R 0603 branch links (fallback filter footprints). R604 10R + C604 10u = TCXO RC, fc ~1.6 kHz.\n- +3V3_SYN from dedicated low-noise LDO (TBD); LC/pi filter at LDO input if fed from a switcher. REF_25M from TCXO (TBD).\n- GND pins 8,9,11,18,21,27,31: own via each, not to EP. EP: >=9-via array."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
